SY_TALK("8E5NGt4W8KM",[[10,["It’s such a pleasure to be in the ashram in San Diego."]],[16,["And it’s such a beautiful place,"]],[20,["so much expressing the love of God,"]],[25,["the Divine, the way it wants to help you at every step."]],[31,["If you want to have an ashram,"]],[33,["if you want to have a proper place,"]],[36,["you want to look after your children well,"]],[39,["you want to do God’s work,"]],[43,["everything is looked after,"]],[45,["everything has to be worked out."]],[48,["If it is not worked out,"]],[51,["then how will you do your work?"]],[54,["So, it all works out."]],[56,["And it’s so obvious, the way we have different ashrams,"]],[61,["such comfortable places"]],[64,["at a very reasonable amount that we can afford,"]],[69,["that we can live happily together."]],[72,["This is the abode created by love for you."]],[77,["So, the first thing we have to remember,"]],[79,["that among ourselves we should have complete love."]],[86,["We should not trust people who try to"]],[93,["divide us,"]],[95,["who try to give us wrong ideas."]],[100,["It’s very easy to make out a person who is a Sahaja yogi"]],[105,["from the heart."]],[107,["It’s very easy to make out."]],[108,["You have to be a little more sensitive"]],[111,["and you’ll find out such a person very easily."]],[113,["Whatever may be the cunning, it can be discovered."]],[118,["Nobody can act against God now,"]],[120,["because everything will be discovered and will be found out."]],[125,["But we have to have our attention fully"]],[131,["on your Mother."]],[135,["But some people do get little more fanatic"]],[138,["because they are so attached, doesn’t matter,"]],[140,["you’ll come round."]],[142,["But is better to be fanatic than to be doubting."]],[145,["So those people who do things little over,"]],[151,["should commit to a life"]],[155,["that whatever they see,"]],[157,["whatever they understand in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[159,["whatever happens, they will accept it"]],[163,["without any anxiety about it."]],[166,["This is the point, that we build up"]],[170,["our images about Sahaja Yoga also."]],[173,["We cannot build up – it is what it is."]],[176,["We cannot build up our image"]],[178,["that we think Sahaja Yoga should be like this,"]],[181,["Sahaja Yoga should be like that – it cannot be."]],[183,["You cannot compromise, you just cannot compromise."]],[186,["It has to be what it is."]],[188,["It cannot be anything that you want it to be."]],[192,["You cannot mould it, because it is fixed long time back."]],[197,["Now it is what it is,"]],[199,["and that is why it is working out so well, so efficiently."]],[204,["But to make it more efficient"]],[207,["you have to accept its working."]],[210,["Like yesterday’s timings, you see:"]],[213,["I knew there must be something,"]],[215,["and the time was not yet ready."]],[219,["The time I spent here"]],[221,["would have been spent raising their kundalini,"]],[225,["unnecessarily wasted."]],[226,["Instead of that, five minutes I took,"]],[229,["it took Me to give them realization."]],[231,["So, it’s, everything has to be understood in that light."]],[238,["Gradually you will start seeing the divine play,"]],[241,["how things work out,"]],[243,["how it helps you."]],[246,["But supposing God has brought"]],[251,["something before you."]],[254,["Dr. Worlikar told Me a nice story about this"]],[259,["which is very interesting,"]],[260,["that between the Goddess of wealth"]],[263,["and the Goddess of education there was a little conflict."]],[268,["You can say education or the Saraswati,"]],[272,["which if neglected"]],[276,["or if too much adored can make you egoistical,"]],[281,["in the sense that if you become a person"]],[284,["who is after learning, learning, learning,"]],[286,["you can be thrown on the other side."]],[289,["So, this lady wanted to test the power of wealth."]],[296,["So, She said to the Laksmi that"]],[298,["“All right, let’s see, on this person.”"]],[301,["This person was a beggar, he needed money,"]],[306,["and very much."]],[308,["So, Laksmi put lot of money in a big utensils,"]],[313,["what we call handa,"]],[315,["and put it in his way."]],[319,["This fellow was walking,"]],[324,["so Saraswati entered into his mind."]],[327,["As soon as Saraswati enters into the mind"]],[330,["he became egoistical, and he didn’t even look at that,"]],[334,["he just walked off."]],[335,["That was his need, but he walked off."]],[338,["So it suggests one thing, that when people become egoistical,"]],[343,["start making their own plans,"]],[346,["start making their own suggestions and images they form,"]],[351,["then what happens that the Divine,"]],[356,["which is trying to supply for your need,"]],[359,["for your wants, for your solutions, disappears."]],[365,["This is what happens,"]],[367,["that we do not allow the Divine to have its play."]],[371,["This is not only on material level;"]],[374,["it is true also on emotional level,"]],[377,["it is true also on our physical level,"]],[385,["but the best of all"]],[387,["that it is true about spiritual level also."]],[390,["So we should not miss the point."]],[392,["Let the Divine play its role, and we should be able to see."]],[397,["Like Krishna has said, “Karmanyevadikaraste”"]],[400,["– “It is our job to do the job.”"]],[402,["Now we’ve done the puja, aarti’s done."]],[406,["I said, “All right, if we can do it, all right;"]],[410,["if we cannot, I’ll go by the evening plane.”"]],[412,["I am not bothered, whether I go by morning plane"]],[415,["or evening plane doesn’t matter."]],[417,["I’m absolutely relaxed."]],[419,["We discussed certain important points had to be discussed,"]],[422,["some time had to be spent;"]],[424,["that has to be done, that’s part of our life."]],[427,["So I’m not anxious that I should go by one o’clock plane."]],[430,["All right, I’ll go by the night plane,"]],[432,["makes no difference to Me."]],[433,["So just to have a very relaxed mind,"]],[438,["to watch how things come forward."]],[442,["People unnecessarily –"]],[462,["Now when we understand"]],[465,["that the Divine is having its complete play,"]],[469,["its own working,"]],[474,["the whole thing is working for us,"]],[476,["for you, the Sahaja yogis."]],[479,["Once you realize that,"]],[481,["then you feel absolutely relaxed and you are in joy."]],[486,["But when you start,"]],[488,["“Oh, this should have been like this,"]],[490,["that should have been like this,”"]],[492,["then everything is against joy."]],[497,["Whichever way it comes is all right."]],[500,["Once you develop that attitude,"]],[502,["then the joy will be complete."]],[506,["I have seen in emotional life also"]],[508,["if you people suffer too much."]],[511,["The reason is, for everything you start thinking."]],[516,["Now in India, how we get married is very simple, you see."]],[520,["From childhood we are taught that “You’ll be married,"]],[524,["so you must learn how to live with your husband,”"]],[528,["and a man is always told how to treat your wife."]],[532,["But they don’t know who is the wife and the husband."]],[534,["But the husband and wife is just a sort of a symbol."]],[539,["They don’t know which one it is;"]],[541,["just could be anyone."]],[543,["So, once you accept her as a dharma,"]],[546,["it comes as a surprise to you, and just enjoy."]],[550,["And the whole thing is built up to a point,"]],[553,["to a moment which has to be auspicious also."]],[556,["Of course, they consult the horoscopes,"]],[559,["that’s an important part,"]],[560,["because horoscopes if you don’t consult,"]],[563,["could be quite disastrous."]],[564,["So, they consult the horoscopes."]],[566,["And if there are so many points"]],[569,["– they say twenty-six points is ideal"]],[571,["– then they get married, otherwise they don’t."]],[574,["Now it’s not necessary that we do not meet or we meet."]],[581,["Sometimes the people meet, talk to each other for one year,"]],[584,["may be that their marriages are postponed,"]],[587,["there’s no auspicious time."]],[588,["They get some time to be together,"]],[591,["but never in private;"]],[593,["they never go into privacy."]],[595,["So that moment is kept as sacred moment,"]],[598,["when you are going to meet your husband or wife"]],[601,["– that’s a very sacred moment,"]],[603,["so you are concentrated on that point."]],[609,["So suddenly it is decided."]],[612,["Now, you keep that moment as sacred moment."]],[614,["Even sometimes it happens that you get some time in between,"]],[619,["quite a lot, after decision;"]],[621,["could be that you have to continue"]],[624,["as a feeling, seeing that person."]],[627,["But then you do not divert your attention,"]],[629,["it’s completely concentrated effort."]],[633,["It clicks, because you just accept it."]],[638,["But here people live together for three years,"]],[641,["then they marry and divorce."]],[643,["I mean I can’t understand, even if three years you live,"]],[645,["seven years you live, ten years they live,"]],[647,["still they do the same."]],[648,["So, what’s the use of knowing each other for so many years,"]],[651,["still you divorce?"]],[653,["But it just clicks if you understand that"]],[655,["it’s a concentrated movement"]],[657,["where you have everything concentrated,"]],[660,["and you just meet the person and accept that person"]],[664,["as your companion."]],[666,["Maybe one or two fail, but if you don’t think about it,"]],[671,["it won’t fail so much."]],[672,["Because after marriage you start thinking,"]],[674,["“Oh I expected this, I expected that."]],[678,["I thought this would be so; that’s not so.”"]],[681,["And always trying to find fault with another,"]],[684,["not with yourself – that’s the best part of it;"]],[687,["not seeing that how you are adjusting to that person."]],[691,["Once you start thinking about marriage,"]],[693,["marriage is finished, already done with."]],[698,["As a child is born to you, without thinking"]],[703,["what sort of a child is going to come, you love the child,"]],[705,["in the same way in the marriage"]],[707,["you’ll have to develop that kind of a concentrated feeling."]],[711,["Then only marriages will be successful."]],[714,["But here, you see, like when you purchase something,"]],[717,["you buy something, all right,"]],[719,["then you think, “Oh, it was not good,"]],[722,["I should have bought something else,"]],[723,["would have been better,” this, that."]],[726,["So, you go to another thing."]],[728,["Things are different; things are things."]],[732,["Human beings are living things,"]],[734,["they are not dead things"]],[736,["that you can change one from another,"]],[739,["“I could have got that one or that one.”"]],[742,["You cannot go on like this with human beings"]],[744,["– you’re playing with the Divine then."]],[748,["And this is the main point where we feel that"]],[752,["Sahaja yogis have to learn to accept"]],[757,["with joy, with happiness,"]],[758,["and not to project nonsensical ideas."]],[764,["Then only you will find your joy will be complete."]],[767,["Otherwise it will not be."]],[769,["Then if you come, say, to the physical side:"]],[772,["like here it is, if a woman is very thin,"]],[776,["she wants to have legs like this, hands like this,"]],[779,["body like this. Why?"]],[782,["I mean, imagine everybody to be regimented"]],[784,["into certain patterns, so much of the waist,"]],[787,["so much of the thing – horrible it will be."]],[790,["I mean you’ll be tired and fed-up with that."]],[792,["So, you want to be like that."]],[794,["Now the fashion comes in that physically"]],[797,["we should be Mr. America or whatever you may call it."]],[801,["So everybody is doing jogging, everybody running like mad."]],[805,["But why? You have your own personality, keep it up."]],[809,["You need certain things for your body, the way you are."]],[813,["Of course, if your health is not all right"]],[815,["then you try with your chakras, cure it."]],[818,["But to appearances, to think that"]],[821,["“I should look like this, I should be like that,”"]],[823,["makes no difference at all."]],[825,["So again, another madness starts, so people are very unhappy."]],[829,["You see, you go to these very so-called elite classes"]],[833,["where most of the men are very highly paid,"]],[836,["educated, top class people,"]],[839,["women are also educated, everything,"]],[842,["and what they talk is this only:"]],[844,["how much calories you eat, this is that."]],[847,["You don’t understand, what’s the matter with these people?"]],[849,["Their level is so low."]],[853,["That’s a decent talk, and if they come to indecency,"]],[856,["they can go to any level also there."]],[859,["So that shows that there has been no evolution"]],[862,["in that person."]],[863,["They just think on those terms."]],[866,["And that’s how they become very serious,"]],[868,["very seriously they discuss all this thing."]],[870,["You feel like laughing at them, the way they are stupid."]],[874,["So, all these things are regarded"]],[876,["as so important in a country like America"]],[878,["or any other country, shows the kind of people they have."]],[884,["I mean, in India nobody is so much bothered about the figure."]],[886,["At least in My age people never liked very thin girls,"]],[890,["because they thought they must be very irritable,"]],[893,["hot-tempered, all the time thinking."]],[895,["They never liked very thin girls I really tell you;"]],[898,["even now My husband doesn’t like."]],[899,["He says, “You see, men have befooled women,"]],[902,["and that’s why women are doing all these things.”"]],[905,["You see, he’s a simple man,"]],[906,["so he thinks that the men have befooled them."]],[909,["So, it’s like that, and then they make legs like this"]],[912,["or teeth like this or nose like this"]],[914,["and you take a plastic nose, put on – why?"]],[918,["So physical also imbalances come in when we start thinking."]],[923,["Because when we think, we collide with another thinking,"]],[926,["then we form a general thinking,"]],[929,["then a general pattern is accepted."]],[931,["When that is accepted people say, “All right, let’s have it.”"]],[935,["First, they used to have very tight clothes, you see,"]],[938,["and one girl was boasting to Me that she wore"]],[940,["it for eight days and she can’t take it out now."]],[942,["I said, “How, how did you manage?”"]],[944,["She said, “This is something that you can wear"]],[946,["and jump into the tub,"]],[949,["and then it shrinks and you can’t take it out."]],[952,["You can have bath with this,"]],[953,["you can do what you like with this.”"]],[956,["I said, “It’s very filthy.”"]],[957,["“No, no, you can wash it nicely and wipe it.”"]],[960,["But I said, “Why, why do such a thing"]],[962,["which will completely coagulate your blood inside?”"]],[966,["Now they started suffering,"]],[968,["so now they’re having absolutely loose clothes, you see,"]],[971,["lanky-pankies, casual, this thing."]],[975,["So, they jump from one to another"]],[977,["when you go on thinking about it,"]],[979,["trying to devise new methods."]],[982,["But tradition is different."]],[984,["Tradition is that when people are traditional,"]],[989,["what happens actually, those people who are sensible"]],[991,["can only become traditional,"]],[993,["because they understand whatever is to be discarded,"]],[996,["whatever is not to be discarded."]],[998,["And they try to understand how we are going to ascend."]],[1001,["Not by taking one side,"]],[1003,["but on both the sides we must weigh"]],[1005,["and balance ourselves and then go ahead."]],[1008,["And whatever is to be discarded to be discarded,"]],[1010,["whatever is to be good is to be taken up."]],[1014,["Like what you call the trial and error business."]],[1018,["You see, you make the error – all right, give it up;"]],[1021,["then take another – all right, give it up."]],[1023,["Whatever is good, you keep it and go on with it,"]],[1027,["and that’s how you build up a proper tradition"]],[1029,["for other people to follow."]],[1031,["But those who think of the new things all the time,"]],[1034,["they want to have something new all the time,"]],[1037,["then they are very much mistaken,"]],[1039,["that when they do like this what we call is a tomfoolery."]],[1043,["With the new things they can land themselves"]],[1046,["into terrible messes, and that’s what exactly has happened"]],[1049,["to most of the Western countries,"]],[1052,["that everything new they try."]],[1053,["Now the new craze is cocaine – all right, have cocaine."]],[1057,["I mean, even I would not be surprised"]],[1060,["if Prince Philip takes to such a thing"]],[1062,["or somebody takes to thing like that."]],[1063,["I mean, everybody wants to try new,"]],[1066,["and if you say you cannot try then they say, “Why, why not?”"]],[1072,["This is a very big problem with the Western mind."]],[1075,["So, you all people should also understand,"]],[1077,["don’t try new things in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1083,["Sahaja Yoga is a traditionally built thing."]],[1087,["Don’t try anything new in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1091,["Whatever we have is more than sufficient,"]],[1094,["you don’t try anything new."]],[1095,["People who tried new things have jumped into problems,"]],[1098,["so do not try something new."]],[1102,["Like somebody said that nowadays, you see,"]],[1106,["I heard in London we had some people"]],[1109,["who started giving lectures"]],[1111,["and giving new methods of Sahaja Yoga, suddenly."]],[1116,["And they all went mad."]],[1117,["I mean, their vibrations were crazy,"]],[1120,["I didn’t know what to do with them."]],[1122,["I was quite surprised."]],[1123,["I said, “Why did you try a new method like that?"]],[1126,["What was the need to try a new method?”"]],[1128,["“Oh,” they said, “Well we thought, better try this one.”"]],[1132,["But I said, “I have already told you all the methods."]],[1134,["Have you tried, have you perfected yourself?"]],[1136,["Better try those which I’ve told you,"]],[1139,["and then you can ask Me and then start something new."]],[1143,["But you must understand what you are doing.”"]],[1145,["And also, I’ve seen mediocre Sahaja yogis always do like that,"]],[1148,["try some new method. And they’ll come out with this thing,"]],[1152,["“Now I’ll tell you how to circulate your breath.”"]],[1155,["Why to circulate your breath?"]],[1158,["Suddenly they find out a new method."]],[1160,["Is a common thing, but these are sometimes could be"]],[1163,["very sinister people also, so be careful."]],[1166,["There is no need to try new methods."]],[1169,["Now you have jumped on to that awareness"]],[1172,["where you have to just be steady."]],[1174,["So, don’t try at this point something new."]],[1177,["Just steady yourself, steady yourself in balance"]],[1181,["– that’s very important."]],[1184,["Second point is that everyone"]],[1187,["should be knowledgeable in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1190,["But some people are so funnily knowledgeable"]],[1193,["that I’m sometimes surprised."]],[1195,["Like there was a fellow who was homosexual"]],[1199,["or nonsensical thing,"]],[1200,["and then he told some people that"]],[1203,["“Yes, you see, Mother says it’s all right once in a while.”"]],[1206,["I never said so. I can never say such a thing."]],[1210,["Then somebody said, “Drinking – all right, Mother said.”"]],[1213,["How could I say? There’s no compromise."]],[1216,["Somebody says, “It’s all right, you can do some business.”"]],[1220,["I never said so."]],[1222,["No, you cannot do, these things are not,"]],[1224,["they are not meant for you."]],[1226,["You don’t have to do it at all. Right?"]],[1228,["So, anybody who comes out with such ideas,"]],[1231,["you tell them “nothing of the kind.”"]],[1233,["There’s nothing like that,"]],[1235,["there’s no compromise in Sahaja Yoga, no compromise."]],[1238,["Whatever methods we have learned,"]],[1240,["let us practice them to establish ourselves"]],[1242,["and establish others."]],[1244,["You must keep to your maryadas, to your limits."]],[1247,["Do not try to fly."]],[1249,["Some people think that they are greater Sahaja yogis"]],[1252,["and they will do this and they will do that."]],[1255,["Then remember, that is wrong."]],[1257,["You have to humble down yourself,"]],[1259,["and remember that when you humble down"]],[1262,["you will realize that only the humble people"]],[1265,["are steady people."]],[1270,["So, there should be complete humility."]],[1273,["Try to acquire more knowledge about Sahaja Yoga."]],[1276,["There are so many ways."]],[1278,["I have got all My tapes done already,"]],[1281,["we have got all these Sahaja Yoga books out now"]],[1285,["and also your “Nirmala Yoga” is there"]],[1287,["– so many ways by which you can understand Sahaja Yoga."]],[1291,["If you don’t understand, you can ask each other,"]],[1293,["try to analyse it the way you want to understand,"]],[1297,["that what Mother is saying, is this is what She’s saying."]],[1300,["Because My lectures are in very, very simple language."]],[1304,["I use extremely simple language,"]],[1307,["avoiding all literary language as far as possible of course;"]],[1311,["sometimes I do have to use difficult words, but normally."]],[1314,["So, but beyond that is a very subtle knowledge flowing."]],[1319,["So, to understand that sometimes may be difficult,"]],[1322,["you may try to sort of construct something else out of it,"]],[1326,["may try to sort of interpret something."]],[1329,["If there’s any such problem,"]],[1330,["better consult somebody whom you think"]],[1333,["is capable of advising you."]],[1335,["But you must accept that."]],[1338,["You should not put forward your viewpoint,"]],[1340,["and it would be very wrong."]],[1342,["Then you will be sort of like a derailed train"]],[1346,["which goes out of track."]],[1349,["We have a track in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1351,["you must know that, whether you like it or not."]],[1353,["It’s no question of freedom, but the track to ascend."]],[1357,["You cannot get out of that track."]],[1359,["If you think you can just move about a little bit,"]],[1362,["have a nice time with all filth"]],[1366,["and then come back to Sahaja Yoga, you won’t be acceptable."]],[1369,["If you do that then I’ll have to work hard"]],[1372,["to cleanse you out, do this, do that."]],[1374,["But to keep yourself clean you’d better keep to your tracks"]],[1378,["and don’t get out of it."]],[1379,["Don’t try to find out new things of doing something"]],[1385,["which is not necessary; why do it?"]],[1387,["I mean, simple thing is to understand it’s a waste of energy."]],[1394,["I’ve already found it for you,"]],[1395,["why do you want to do it again?"]],[1397,["Like this kind of a blouse"]],[1398,["I’ve been wearing now for the last, I think,"]],[1402,["fifty years or maybe more, this type of a blouse."]],[1405,["Now My tailor knows that I wear this blouse, this is this,"]],[1409,["this is this. He has got My measurements."]],[1411,["So, I have to just tell him that"]],[1413,["“You get Me a cloth of this kind,"]],[1416,["and just make a blouse for Me.” He makes it."]],[1418,["For the last so many years I have had,"]],[1420,["about twenty-five years, I had one tailor who does My job."]],[1424,["He has no headache, I have no headache, no problem."]],[1426,["Every day if I have to change this pattern,"]],[1429,["make a new sleeve and a new type of a blouse,"]],[1432,["I’ll have a headache, I mean, I tell you."]],[1435,["So why, why do that? What’s the use?"]],[1438,["Who sees, who is affected by that?"]],[1441,["So unnecessarily we are wasting our energy on these things."]],[1446,["But I don’t say that you should be regimented,"]],[1449,["by any means, but what I mean that wherever"]],[1453,["you can save your energy of thinking, you should do it."]],[1455,["For small, small things there’s no need to have varieties,"]],[1459,["and this country as I’ve told you before"]],[1461,["hat every tap has to be different,"]],[1463,["every handle is to be different,"]],[1465,["every tile has to be different – what is the need?"]],[1469,["What has to be different is artistic things."]],[1472,["Sari has to be different because it is artistic."]],[1476,["But what is in a stitching of a blouse,"]],[1478,["there’s no art in it involved."]],[1479,["So, whatever is artistic can be different,"]],[1482,["but whatever is mundane need not be."]],[1484,["In the machinery why should you have"]],[1487,["different types of things, you’ll go mad."]],[1488,["You go to a shop, there’s twenty types of things,"]],[1491,["you don’t which one to buy, all made by machine only."]],[1494,["This is good, that is good."]],[1496,["Then another fellow he comes, he says, “Not good.”"]],[1498,["Then you feel hurt."]],[1500,["But if you have for mundane things, few things is better,"]],[1504,["that you do not take too many headaches upon yourself."]],[1508,["So best thing to avoid all these problems"]],[1511,["is to use your new awareness of vibrations."]],[1514,["So, you save your energies."]],[1516,["Your energies must be saved,"]],[1518,["and they can be saved if you do not pay attention to things"]],[1522,["which are not your style, where you don’t have to go."]],[1526,["Just see vibrations. If I go for shopping"]],[1529,["– now I go shopping for various reasons, as you know."]],[1532,["One is to put My vibrations there;"]],[1535,["another is to put also vibrations on the people"]],[1539,["who are in the market."]],[1541,["Thirdly is to look at all the things,"]],[1543,["so My vibrations go onto them."]],[1545,["Fourthly, to buy something to be given to others."]],[1548,["But if I like something it is only through vibrations"]],[1552,["and I buy it somehow,"]],[1556,["because it is to be given to someone"]],[1559,["or something has to be done later."]],[1561,["I just buy it, keep it, it comes very handy."]],[1566,["That is how your attitude should be."]],[1569,["But on the contrary if you just go on,"]],[1572,["“I like this, I don’t like it,” about your wife,"]],[1575,["about your jobs, your everything, you’ll be uncertain."]],[1578,["These days in America"]],[1580,["people are very funny about their jobs also."]],[1583,["I have to touch these points,"]],[1584,["because you’ll face this problem."]],[1586,["Today they’re doing some job, “I don’t like it,"]],[1588,["I don’t like my boss” – another job."]],[1590,["Then they’ll go to another job, they change it."]],[1592,["Then third job, change it."]],[1594,["They like to change, you know, all the time"]],[1596,["– it’s maddening, I tell you."]],[1599,["Change their wives, change their house,"]],[1601,["change everything. Why?"]],[1604,["Have only one wife, is better."]],[1608,["At the most have two jobs in life, is better."]],[1612,["And at the most change three residences, is better."]],[1616,["But more than that is a headache."]],[1619,["I mean, to Me, I have changed forty houses"]],[1621,["because of My husband’s temperament."]],[1626,["But I’m different, because I’m absolutely a person"]],[1631,["who is not bothered whatever change comes."]],[1634,["But you are not the same, so don’t waste your energy."]],[1637,["So, this is very important to understand,"]],[1639,["not to go on changing jobs, is very important."]],[1644,["Because that is also a craze, I tell you."]],[1646,["I’ll tell you about Douglas. He used to do that."]],[1649,["Every time he had financial problem"]],[1651,["because he was changing jobs. So, one day I told him off."]],[1655,["I said, “Douglas, if you change this job”"]],[1658,["– because I saw the vibrations are all right"]],[1660,["– “if you change this job,"]],[1661,["that you are not going to see Me again.”"]],[1663,["And now today he has got a house, he’s got a car,"]],[1667,["he’s got money in the bank, he’s doing well."]],[1674,["So that also is a headache for Me,"]],[1677,["“Mother, I have no job, I have no money. What am I to do?”"]],[1682,["Every time there are people who come to India, they say,"]],[1686,["“Mother, I have no money, I’m sorry I couldn’t pay You.”"]],[1689,["All right, doesn’t matter."]],[1691,["There are at least, this last time also there were five people."]],[1694,["But before that I think there were about twenty people."]],[1697,["So, every time it happens like this."]],[1700,["So now we must understand, we must have proper jobs."]],[1703,["We have to be respectable people."]],[1705,["We must have proper qualifications,"]],[1707,["if possible, better to get some qualifications."]],[1710,["You are all very intelligent people"]],[1712,["and you can get your qualifications."]],[1715,["You should have a respectability in the society."]],[1718,["Otherwise they’ll think that this Mother"]],[1720,["is the Mother of all the beggars."]],[1725,["So steady yourself in your jobs, in your houses."]],[1729,["To steady yourself you must learn not to change."]],[1739,["The change makes you unsteady – do you see the point?"]],[1744,["So, there is no question of changing."]],[1745,["“I’m going to go through it.”"]],[1748,["Then if it is necessary, if it is not workable,"]],[1752,["then one can change."]],[1755,["It applies to everything."]],[1758,["Now, guru-shopping is nothing but change."]],[1762,["The more gurus you have, the greater headache I have."]],[1766,["If you have only one guru, say horrible one,"]],[1769,["it’s all right, easy to clear you out."]],[1771,["But if you have been to twenty, whatever am I to do?"]],[1774,["One fellow who has been to gurus so much"]],[1777,["that I couldn’t understand his personality."]],[1779,["I said, “What’s the matter with this?”"]],[1781,["Every problem, you name it and it’s there."]],[1784,["I said, “What sort of a fellow is this?”"]],[1786,["So, I said, “All right, write it down"]],[1787,["all the names of all the gurus you have been to.”"]],[1789,["He wrote three foolscap papers on both the sides."]],[1794,["I said, “I’m sorry, sir, I can’t help you.”"]],[1796,["He said, “Mother, You have to,"]],[1798,["because there’s a very immediate problem.”"]],[1800,["I said, “What is the immediate problem?”"]],[1802,["“That now I am becoming a woman.”"]],[1805,["I said, “Hah?”"]],[1808,["“The doctors have said that now I’m becoming a woman.”"]],[1812,["I said, “That’s really an immediate problem.”"]],[1815,["I said, “That much I can stop, but you need lot of cleansing.”"]],[1819,["And he used to sometimes look like Hanumana,"]],[1822,["sometimes he looks like a madman,"]],[1823,["he used to look like anything,"]],[1825,["because so many gurus in him were working it out."]],[1828,["Ultimately that he got himself cleansed out"]],[1832,["and his problem was solved,"]],[1834,["but even now I would not say that he is a Sahaja yogi;"]],[1837,["though he’s very learned, knows all about Sanskrit"]],[1839,["because he has been to so many gurus,"]],[1841,["every type of guru he has been."]],[1845,["This has come by change – “what’s wrong?”"]],[1849,["So, once you come to Sahaja Yoga, then stop."]],[1854,["Stop everything else."]],[1857,["Second point that I stressed was this,"]],[1861,["that in Sahaja Yoga once you come,"]],[1864,["focus yourself to Me and Sahaja Yoga first,"]],[1867,["and then other things."]],[1869,["Like Christians when they come to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1871,["they can’t accept Ganesh."]],[1873,["Indians who come to Sahaja Yoga cannot accept Christ."]],[1877,["Muslims who come to Sahaja Yoga cannot take to puja."]],[1882,["Everybody is coming with a load behind them."]],[1885,["So better come and put them at My feet, finished."]],[1888,["Now you see them through My prism,"]],[1892,["through Me – is better to understand that way."]],[1896,["And those who have understood Me that way,"]],[1899,["just understand Sahaja Yoga in a perfect manner."]],[1902,["There’s no fanaticism of the past,"]],[1905,["neither of Sahaja Yoga either."]],[1907,["So, they understand that this is all the same as Mother is,"]],[1911,["and there’s nothing to be sticking"]],[1914,["onto one thing or to another."]],[1916,["But it doesn’t mean that if you call Me"]],[1920,["the Goddess Kali you are insulting Me,"]],[1923,["or if you call Me Mataji Nirmala Devi you’re elevating Me"]],[1926,["– it’s all there."]],[1929,["So one has to understand that all this"]],[1933,["is related to our own compartments."]],[1936,["God has no compartments like that."]],[1940,["It is not that America exists in His mind,"]],[1943,["or it is not that anything exists in mind."]],[1946,["Do we exist like “now I am only my Vishuddhi”"]],[1950,["– do we exist like that?"]],[1951,["Or “I’m only my nose” – do we?"]],[1954,["We exist as the whole body."]],[1956,["So, God exists – though He has a nose, He has His ears, say,"]],[1960,["everything is there; but He exists as God."]],[1963,["He doesn’t exist like a nose, separate,"]],[1966,["doesn’t exist like only America separate,"]],[1968,["but He’s existing as the whole,"]],[1971,["everything related to the whole."]],[1977,["And when such a thing happens to us"]],[1980,["that now we are related to the whole, the Primordial Being,"]],[1984,["we should not relate ourselves"]],[1986,["to something that will localize us"]],[1988,["because of our conditionings."]],[1991,["No localization should be there,"]],[1993,["we should be in circulation."]],[1995,["I find it difficult for people who have been Catholics"]],[1998,["to worship Shri Ganesh with the same respect,"]],[2003,["because they are conditioned."]],[2004,["So, try to leave it for a while, Christ,"]],[2007,["completely leave Him alone."]],[2008,["Come to Sahaja Yoga, then you’ll see Him in proper light."]],[2012,["Because this is the problem is,"]],[2015,["that unless and until you come inside and see for yourself"]],[2020,["that all roads have come to this one thing,"]],[2023,["so they are just the same, there’s no difference at all."]],[2026,["First come inside."]],[2027,["Give up everything, come inside."]],[2030,["Then you will know that it’s all the same."]],[2032,["And this is very important,"]],[2035,["and once you see that,"]],[2037,["it’s such a beautiful thing that you have no complications"]],[2041,["of any kind, belonging to any particular cult"]],[2045,["or particular guru or a particular thing."]],[2048,["Even so-called religions are like cults if you see to it,"]],[2052,["they are like cults, they have conditionings."]],[2055,["They have not given you anything but conditioning"]],[2057,["and illusions."]],[2058,["So, we are not to live with illusions,"]],[2060,["we have to live with reality."]],[2061,["And the reality is that, that all these essences are one,"]],[2066,["and we have to be inside them"]],[2068,["so that we can see them, all of them as one."]],[2072,["This is also very important thing in country like America,"]],[2077,["I feel, because there are such diverse ideas,"]],[2080,["such diverse ideas that I, I’m surprised at them."]],[2084,["Everything you name it is in America."]],[2086,["The other day I developed one thing called Mormon,"]],[2090,["Mormon or something. Mormon."]],[2093,["Name it and it’s in America."]],[2095,["I don’t know how all the varieties have gathered here."]],[2100,["Every sort of a guru, I mean, you discover them here."]],[2103,["I had never heard of so many names."]],[2105,["Whenever I come, I’d find a new guru coming up."]],[2108,["Why America is the place where all these prosper like this,"]],[2111,["like mushrooms, you see?"]],[2113,["A mushroom is growing, that is – is it a rottening thing?"]],[2116,["Only mushroom grows as fungus."]],[2120,["Is it rottening, this country? What’s happening? Why?"]],[2125,["It is the mind of human beings."]],[2128,["The mind of human beings here always wants a new thing,"]],[2132,["and that’s why a supply comes."]],[2135,["As a result of that they become unsteady."]],[2137,["So, the main problem of American character"]],[2141,["is that they are very unsteady people."]],[2145,["You ask them, “How are you?” They also say …."]],[2149,["Understand whatever you like."]],[2150,["They’ll never say “How are you?” …."]],[2154,["What do you understand with that?"]],[2156,["I mean, an Indian person can’t understand."]],[2158,["If somebody says like that, an Indian, you see,"]],[2161,["if you ask him, “How are you?”"]],[2162,["and he says like this, they’ll say, “Are you mad?”"]],[2169,["Then if you ask them, “Do you understand this?”"]],[2172,["“I’m confused.”"]],[2174,["An Indian will never say such a thing,"]],[2176,["“I’m confused.” He’s cocksure."]],[2179,["“I’m confused” means, are you a lunatic or what?"]],[2181,["Why are you confused? Something wrong with your brain?"]],[2187,["So, all these ideas, you see,"]],[2189,["are tending towards our unsteadiness,"]],[2193,["frivolousness, superficiality."]],[2195,["You are really bombarded by superficiality,"]],[2199,["bombarded, I can see that."]],[2201,["Absolutely from everywhere, you see, the media, this, that:"]],[2204,["it’s nothing but superficial."]],[2206,["It really kills the inner germ in the human being."]],[2210,["And you want to live with it,"]],[2212,["then you want to think on those lines,"]],[2215,["and really you lose yourself, all contact with yourself is lost."]],[2219,["Under all these circumstances one has to know"]],[2221,["one beautiful fact,"]],[2223,["that so many seekers are born in this country."]],[2227,["It’s America which I visited the first."]],[2233,["And I’m sure San Diego is the place where it will start,"]],[2236,["I have a feeling."]],[2239,["[Marathi]"]],[2245,["So this is a place very important, and I’m nice,"]],[2248,["I’m happy that you have arranged this wonderful puja,"]],[2251,["and we should do this puja."]],[2253,["And I am sure by this we will have a time,"]],[2259,["especially good time coming"]],[2263,["where we’ll have on one side American evolution,"]],[2269,["on the other side, Mexican."]],[2272,["This we can work out from San Diego."]],[2275,["It’s a beautiful day that you have asked for this puja."]],[2279,["I’m very happy about it."]],[2281,["Today is the day of the Goddess,"]],[2283,["[Marathi] – Thrayodashi."]],[2292,["Thrayodashi is the best, thirteenth day."]],[2295,["[Marathi]"]],[2312,["See the vibrations, you don’t need any puja!"]],[2323,["There’s no need to have a puja, really, it is so much today."]],[2326,["So today is a great day,"]],[2327,["and I’m happy he’s asked for this puja here."]],[2330,["So, now to begin with …."]],[2335,["Now if you have any problems, any questions,"]],[2339,["you must let Me know."]],[2341,["One thing, a Sahaja yogi should not be"]],[2344,["a serious person, that’s one thing."]],[2348,["That doesn’t behove a Sahaja yogi to be serious."]],[2352,["You should be smiling, laughing, enjoying."]],[2354,["If he’s a serious person then he’s not a Sahaja yogi."]],[2357,["I can’t keep serious for more than five minutes,"]],[2360,["at the most five minutes."]],[2362,["Even if I have to scold somebody, I prepare Myself,"]],[2365,["then I come down and I shout,"]],[2368,["and then after five minutes if I don’t run away"]],[2371,["then you’ll find Me again laughing."]],[2373,["Can’t – it’s all a joke!"]],[2381,["So, nobody should be serious, that’s one thing."]],[2384,["Nobody should be serious."]],[2386,["You should be always smiling and happy people,"]],[2388,["because there is joy within you. What is there?"]],[2391,["Only by thinking “I’m miserable, I’m miserable,” you see"]],[2398,["– that’s French style!"]],[2400,["French, you know, when I went there first time, they told Me,"]],[2403,["“Mother, You look too happy” – for French."]],[2409,["So, I said, “What should I do?”"]],[2410,["Said, “Do You see, they are all very,"]],[2412,["they think they are very Misérables people, this, that.”"]],[2415,["So, I said, “All right.” So I went and said,"]],[2417,["“Now see, you are all les Misérables”"]],[2419,["– you know Victor Hugo has written this “Les Misérables”"]],[2423,["– so I said, “All right, you les miserables."]],[2425,["Now I am a person who is not miserable at all."]],[2428,["And you will be miserable in any case if you have,"]],[2431,["every third house you have a pub,"]],[2436,["every tenth house you have a prostitute,"]],[2439,["so what will happen? I mean, you are in for it.”"]],[2443,["That’s what it is."]],[2444,["And even Yogi Mahajan told Me that"]],[2447,["“Mother, we want Your photograph which is very serious,"]],[2450,["it is hard to get one,"]],[2452,["and we must put a face which is very serious.”"]],[2456,["And ultimately, he ended up with a photograph"]],[2459,["which was horrid."]],[2461,["When he told Me, “It’s a very nice photograph,"]],[2464,["You look so serene,” this, that and all the descriptions."]],[2468,["When I saw the photograph I said, “It’s horrid!”"]],[2471,["He said, “Really?”"]],[2473,["I said, “All right, let Me tell you who has done this.”"]],[2476,["He said, “Who?” I told him the name and he was shocked."]],[2480,["I said, “That’s the lady who has given you,"]],[2482,["and you know where she is today.”"]],[2485,["Was shocked how I told the name “Jane.”"]],[2492,["I said, “This is the photograph you are sending to Americans.”"]],[2495,["But I know Americans will be attracted by that photograph,"]],[2498,["because they are miserable themselves, you see."]],[2502,["But such people who are attracted"]],[2505,["to that kind of a photograph will drop out in no time,"]],[2508,["they will not stick on – you don’t understand that point."]],[2512,["They are not the type who’ll stick on."]],[2514,["Like in Scotland, I went there"]],[2515,["and there was a photograph I saw, and I got a shock."]],[2519,["We had gone to a restaurant where we were to have our food,"]],[2522,["and I saw My photograph and I said, “Who has done this one?”"]],[2525,["They said, “This is the copy of one of the Australian ones.”"]],[2528,["I said, “But who has done it?"]],[2531,["Because this is not good – very bad.”"]],[2534,["So, they said, “This is done by someone, suddenly.”"]],[2540,["I said, “I’ll name the person,”"]],[2541,["and I told them who has done it: Hilary."]],[2545,["They were all amazed at it."]],[2548,["I said, “This photograph is no good.”"]],[2551,["But now they had put it everywhere. I said, “Let it be.”"]],[2553,["So many people came to My program, all funny types, you know."]],[2558,["Some had one eye, some had one nose,"]],[2560,["some had something else wrong, everything missing."]],[2565,["“Oh God,” I said, “this is the thing of the photograph.”"]],[2568,["And not one person came back."]],[2572,["We had at least about five,"]],[2574,["six hundred people for the program, all like this, you see."]],[2577,["[Marathi]"]],[2581,["And none of them came back, not one person."]],[2586,["All bhoots, attracted by the bhoot; and I could see"]],[2590,["on My photograph that it was just repelling it."]],[2596,["So those who take My photograph also"]],[2600,["reflect in the photograph."]],[2606,["You must have seen Ray’s photograph come out very well."]],[2610,["I don’t which one is Ray’s here,"]],[2612,["but Ray’s photographs used to be very good."]],[2614,["And this time Ray, he has a funny wife, I think."]],[2617,["He went to India, and Indians told Me,"]],[2620,["“Mother, I don’t know how this Ray is so ruined.”"]],[2622,["In India it doesn’t happen."]],[2623,["Once a Sahaja yogi, then they improve."]],[2626,["But this fellow was just the opposite – now what to do?"]],[2630,["They said, “Mother, he’s all gone down, what to do?”"]],[2632,["I said, “Must have been something wrong. What to do?”"]],[2636,["When I came back, you see,"]],[2638,["Ray brought three or four photographs of Mine."]],[2640,["When he showed, everybody was shocked."]],[2642,["“These are not Mother’s photographs.”"]],[2646,["And he had to withdraw them. This is what it is."]],[2650,["Same Ray who made such beautiful photographs"]],[2653,["was having horrible photographs nowadays."]],[2656,["So, in everything what you do, everything that you achieve,"]],[2661,["you can make it out."]],[2662,["You suddenly become an extremely posh person, you can say,"]],[2668,["with a finesse, once you are a good Sahaja yogi."]],[2671,["Everything comes in proper stream."]],[2675,["You can make it out, very simple ways"]],[2678,["of such a person are so pleasing and so soothing."]],[2685,["So, on these points I have covered lots of things"]],[2690,["which I wanted to say, and that end with it"]],[2694,["I would say that as Vishuddhis you have to become the sakshi,"]],[2699,["the witness. You have to become the witness."]],[2702,["And to become the witness there has to be a detachment."]],[2705,["That doesn’t mean you live on a shoestring by any chance,"]],[2708,["but try to have a detachment."]],[2712,["Thank God this time the experience of the Sahaja yogis"]],[2716,["from America was not so bad."]],[2718,["They were very good people,"]],[2720,["they adjusted themselves well and they enjoyed themselves."]],[2723,["It was fine."]],[2724,["And I hope more and more will come and will enjoy themselves."]],[2731,["And as you know the new programming has taken place."]],[2734,["Is better you people tell us if you are coming or not."]],[2737,["But also, don’t change last minute,"]],[2740,["it creates problems for us, for everyone."]],[2745,["So please don’t change; if you’re not coming, it’s all right."]],[2748,["You will have a certain date, by that time you decide,"]],[2751,["don’t change. You see it’s only Americans who did this,"]],[2755,["nobody else."]],[2757,["And we told people,"]],[2759,["“Now no more, let’s give more chance to Americans are coming,"]],[2762,["we should give them more chance; so no, you are not coming.”"]],[2764,["So poor things, they came for ten days, five days,"]],[2768,["because we could not arrange for them."]],[2772,["So, you should not change your ideas."]],[2775,["If you are coming you can decide up to a point,"]],[2779,["if you are coming or not coming."]],[2781,["If you are not coming you just say, “Yes, we are not coming,”"]],[2785,["or if you are coming you just say,"]],[2788,["“Yes we are coming,” and you do it."]],[2791,["At least that much you should not change."]],[2796,["So again, I request you to keep to your schedules and things,"]],[2800,["because it really upsets the whole thing."]],[2803,["Because now we are working on the rhythm of the Divine,"]],[2807,["and we have no business to upset the rhythm."]],[2812,["You may be Americans, but as you know in Sahaja Yoga"]],[2815,["Americans are not placed very high up."]],[2818,["You know that very well."]],[2820,["And we think Italians are much better off;"]],[2823,["they take to Sahaja Yoga just like a fish takes to water."]],[2830,["So, Americans have to work a little harder,"]],[2833,["they have to do a little more to get to that adjustments."]],[2841,["What to do? Such a great a country, so many seekers,"]],[2845,["but they are already ruined – what am I to do?"]],[2848,["Trying My level best."]],[2850,["You all should help and understand the difficulties,"]],[2852,["and you have to be kind to the newcomers and see"]],[2855,["that you put them right."]],[2859,["So, we have to think of our ascent from San Diego,"]],[2866,["and from this corner we are going to enlighten"]],[2870,["the whole of America."]],[2873,["For practical purposes I’ve decided"]],[2877,["that Dr. Worlikar should be in charge"]],[2880,["in the eastern side"]],[2887,["[Marathi]"]],[2890,["– western side."]],[2893,["For us, New York is already western, all right;"]],[2896,["and the eastern side is, the New York side"]],[2900,["can be managed by him."]],[2904,["Because there’s a, like a two countries it is, two countries,"]],[2907,["two different types of thing."]],[2909,["So that is how it is to be managed."]],[2911,["Money matters: you should do deal with money matters"]],[2916,["with his consent."]],[2917,["So, I told him how I do it is that the money"]],[2921,["is kept in the bank under the name of the"]],[2925,["registered name or whichever way it is,"]],[2928,["and they have the check book, but I have to sign."]],[2934,["So, you keep the check book but he has to sign,"]],[2937,["so he sees what you are spending."]],[2940,["So, check is there."]],[2941,["Or you do the same there, see,"]],[2944,["so that she keeps the check book but you sign,"]],[2946,["so you know how much is being spent."]],[2949,["So, there’s a check."]],[2951,["Of course, as far as you people are concerned,"]],[2953,["I know it’s all right, but still …."]],[2956,["Why I do so many things, just to make you understand."]],[2961,["Like if you give Me puja money, I keep a packet of that."]],[2966,["I keep an account of that."]],[2967,["There’s no need: who’s going to ask Me"]],[2969,["what did I do with the puja money?"]],[2971,["But I do, I do keep it."]],[2975,["And then what do I do with the puja money is that"]],[2978,["I want to use it for your puja materials, puja things,"]],[2982,["for presents and things."]],[2983,["So, I keep. I need not do it, that’s My money,"]],[2986,["at least that much is Mine,"]],[2989,["but My pleasure is such."]],[2992,["So that is how one must know that"]],[2995,["if Mother is so strict with it, why not we?"]],[3001,["You have to give money in puja, no doubt,"]],[3004,["because that has to be."]],[3006,["First, we used to take one “p”."]],[3008,["Then I went to two “p”, then to five “p’s”, ten “p’s”"]],[3012,["– it has increased like that."]],[3015,["And for these pujas then,"]],[3017,["for the main pujas that we are going to have,"]],[3019,["one on New York, they have decided certain amount."]],[3022,["That is your decision, I never said anything,"]],[3024,["because I was only up to one pound, I was there."]],[3027,["Then I don’t know, I got lost with these people."]],[3030,["So whatever they decide, that is there,"]],[3034,["is the money that is collected under the name of puja,"]],[3038,["which I have to take for the Nabhi Chakra."]],[3042,["You have to do it with heart, just like the Shabari style,"]],[3047,["and everything will fall in proper places."]],[3053,["So one can say that"]],[3058,["Sahaja Yoga is not an extreme thing."]],[3062,["We do give money;"]],[3064,["only the Sahaja yogis can donate money."]],[3067,["Say, for food here you have to pay,"]],[3070,["for the house you have to pay."]],[3072,["You do pay, you don’t live here like parasites."]],[3075,["We don’t want parasites around us."]],[3078,["But it doesn’t also mean that you rob"]],[3080,["a Sahaja yogi completely and make him a pauper,"]],[3084,["and build your own Rolls Royces!"]],[3090,["So it is not also the other way, that you people rob Me."]],[3100,["So one has to understand that Sahaja Yoga is give and take,"]],[3105,["in a proper certain manners,"]],[3107,["and that has to be properly done with grace,"]],[3112,["with understanding, with a beautiful feeling"]],[3117,["that we are all part and parcel of the whole."]],[3123,["And for which America is responsible,"]],[3128,["because America has to become the Virat."]],[3135,["The Vishuddhi has to become the Virat."]],[3141,["What a responsibility!"]],[3144,["So don’t quarrel among yourselves,"]],[3146,["don’t quarrel among husband and wife."]],[3150,["Try to be one in complete unison, enjoy each other."]],[3157,["That’s very important. All right."]],[3161,["So may God bless you."]],[3162,["[Marathi: This is Virata’s place]"]],[3166,["Even now the Right Vishuddhi is catching. All right."]],[3173,["[Marathi – directions for puja]"]],[3310,["Now, I want those people who have not washed My feet so far,"]],[3315,["should come forward."]],[3321,["One by one."]],[3329,["Let them handle the situation."]],[3332,["… can do it."]],[3333,["Danny, you also come here."]],[3335,["Now, two persons at a time will do it."]],[3353,["It’s very cold water."]],[3368,["Very good, very good. Very, very good."]],[3376,["Rub it. Rub My feet."]],[3448,["Now just see your vibrations."]],[3455,["All right?"]],[3457,["Good?"]],[3459,["May God bless you. Now come along."]],[3462,["Should be warm."]],[3477,["Come along, both of you."]],[3487,["May God bless you."]],[3493,["Rub it."]],[3496,["Put it on this one."]],[3499,["Rub it."]],[3575,["Done! Now, come along – see your vibrations."]],[3587,["Now, keep smiling like that, it’s all right,"]],[3590,["it’s all right – the sari can be dried."]],[3595,["May God bless you."]],[3598,["On the eyes and the head, wipe it."]],[3601,["Come along."]],[3607,["Very good."]],[3622,["May God bless you."]],[3631,["Hold it with one hand, tight, and another hand, rub it hard."]],[3661,["Ah, good. You can feel the vibrations well."]],[3668,["Your right, left hand, rub it – the last finger, pull it out."]],[3674,["Last finger, pull it out."]],[3739,["It’s got it."]],[3742,["Now, see your vibrations."]],[3752,["May God bless you."]],[3755,["On the eyes and the head."]],[3758,["Come along. Your face has changed with this!"]],[3763,["All right? Good. May God bless."]],[3771,["Perfect."]],[3801,["That’s all. Come along. That’s better."]],[3805,["Right, now hold it tight."]],[3811,["Rub your full hand."]],[3813,["You see, the hand, your hand is to be rubbed, not My feet."]],[3819,["Pull that out. Pull it tight."]],[3836,["Ah!"]],[3918,["Mm, good."]],[3922,["I think we are all right."]],[3925,["Now just sit, this side."]],[3934,["All right?"]],[3940,["You can’t keep it."]],[3942,["Put it on your head."]],[3945,["On your head, and then wipe your eyes also."]],[3955,["May God bless you."]],[3967,["I think you come with him, that’s all right."]],[3971,["It’s all right. A little water."]],[3974,["Now, they can use the same water to do My feet. Come along."]],[3986,["May God bless you."]],[3990,["Now..."]],[3998,["Hold it. Rub it hard."]],[4009,["Rub it hard."]],[4057,["Now see."]],[4072,["Now."]],[4076,["All right?"]],[4079,["See the left is – a little bit."]],[4120,["All right."]],[4121,["While sitting, just put the left hand towards Me,"]],[4123,["right hand on the Mother Earth."]],[4126,["Good? May God bless."]],[4202,["Good. Now, just see yourselves."]],[4216,["How are you? All right?"]],[4218,["Not yet, feeling?"]],[4226,["Good. Very good."]],[4235,["May God bless you."]],[4266,["Put your left hand here. Rub it."]],[4308,["All right. Now see for yourself."]],[4319,["All right?"]],[4328,["May God bless you."]],[4335,["Just put it on your head first, and then on your eyes."]],[4342,["Good, nice."]],[4344,["Feeling fine? Shiny, eh?"]],[4361,["Little bit you can lift from this side, this one;"]],[4364,["this side, yes."]],[4370,["That’s all right."]],[4420,["Done!"]],[4423,["See yourself now."]],[4432,["May God bless."]],[4441,["Has he washed?"]],[4445,["Her husband?"]],[4448,["He’s washed My feet?"]],[4451,["You both? Both are washed?"]],[4457,["All right."]],[4460,["So, do you want to wash it again?"]],[4463,["All right. Now come."]],[4469,["Are you all right, Jeshua?"]],[4474,["Better."]],[4478,["All right."]],[4481,["Let him play with the water."]],[4495,["Close his hands."]],[4497,["Ask him to play with the water, would be better."]],[4500,["In the water. Ask him to immerse his feet in the water."]],[4509,["Put it on Mine. Wash My feet."]],[4513,["Good, good, good."]],[4516,["Then touch My feet."]],[4518,["Now put his hands on Mine."]],[4540,["Good. Hallo! All right."]],[4549,["So may God bless you all."]],[4552,["He’s all right now."]],[4555,["You have washed, both of you have washed."]],[4660,["Just put more water."]],[4666,["Pour all that, I think."]],[4672,["And more is needed."]],[4679,["That is better."]],[4802,["Hundred-and-eight names."]],[4812,["You said hundred-and-eight names you have got."]],[4826,["Hundred-and-eight names."]],[4853,["You showed Me thousand names you had."]],[4856,["These are …"]],[4859,["hundred-and-eight."]],[4900,["These are the hundred-and-eight names?"]],[4906,["Of Mahakali."]],[4913,["Oh, take a hundred names."]],[4920,["It starts with Shri Mata?"]],[4922,["Take out that one, all right?"]],[4933,["Sahasranama."]],[4934,["Yes, we have Shri Lalita."]],[4947,["This is the praise,"]],[4949,["after the Goddess killed the two rakshasas"]],[4951,["called Shumba, Nishumba."]],[4953,["They’re all again back on the seat."]],[4956,["So now the praise of the gods,"]],[4960,["you have to do the same praise."]],[4962,["Now, we’ll start – you know that"]],[4965,["up to a point he will read it,"]],[4967,["and then he will tell you that"]],[4971,["you have to put it “Ya Devi sarva bhuteshu”"]],[4973,["– he’ll tell you “Buddhi” so you should put it,"]],[4976,["“Ya Devi sarva bhuteshu Buddhi rupena samsthita.”"]],[4979,["You know that – “Namas Tasyai namas Tasyai"]],[4981,["namas Tasyai namoh namah.”"]],[5103,["First he will say the beginning of it."]],[5106,["This is how the gods, you see, praised the Goddess,"]],[5109,["when She killed Shumba, Nishumba. So …."]],[5117,["The first of all you have to give the – what you call"]],[5120,["– the ghee."]],[5122,["But there is no spoon."]],[5125,["For ghee at least you have some spoons."]],[5192,["Also the moon."]],[5195,["She’s like moon."]],[5197,["Face is like moon …."]],[5204,["Just water."]],[5221,["“Sarva” is the essence."]],[5225,["She’s the one who’s the ruler of everything."]],[5240,["Extremely gentle, and extremely harsh."]],[5254,["We are the intelligence."]],[5259,["She’s the intelligence in every human being."]],[5262,["She’s expressed as intelligence,"]],[5263,["pure intelligence in every human being."]],[5277,["So you just say “Shraddha.”"]],[5279,["And now you repeat together."]],[5281,["You say “Shraddha” – now say."]],[5422,["Should be sugar and then water."]],[5585,["Unmarried girls now."]],[5592,["Unmarried."]],[5646,["She used to do it always in Bombay."]],[5659,["You also do it the same way."]],[5673,["Now."]],[5698,["You should say,"]],[5703,["“Sakshat Shri Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi namoh namah."]],[5706,["Shri Mata Sakshat Shri …”"]],[5709,["– what do you say?"]],[5714,["Just say, “Om twamewa sakshat Shri Mata,”"]],[5717,["that’s all – “namoh namah.”"]],[5719,["Yes, that’s all. That’s all."]],[5727,["[Yogi: These are hundred and eight out of the thousand names"]],[5729,["of Mahadevi given in the “Shri Lalita Sahasranama.”]"]],[5771,["First is “Shri Mata.” So now say"]],[5952,["“Pataka nashini”"]],[5956,["– killer of all the sins."]],[5958,["So that’s why I said, don’t feel guilty."]],[5960,["She’s the killer of all the sins."]],[5964,["Maha-pat: the greatest of –"]],[5968,["Maha-pataka nashini."]],[6175,["“Nistula” – means “uncomparable.”"]],[6285,["You should first of all touch here."]],[6295,["First."]],[6319,["Go and wash your hands."]],[6328,["Unmarried women. Unmarried."]],[6495,["With the Para-shakti,"]],[6496,["all the work which it looks at all happens."]],[6504,["“Yogada.”"]],[6508,["I have given you the yoga, you see, the union."]],[6545,["“Labdhaa. Punya-labhya” – by the punyas."]],[6549,["You see, if you have no punyas, you cannot find any."]],[6553,["So if many people are lost, you shouldn’t worry;"]],[6556,["they have no punyas. What can you do?"]],[6558,["“Punya-labdhaa.”"]],[6634,["“Shobhana-sulabha-gati” – “Shobhana” means “gracious”,"]],[6638,["“sulabha” means “easy” and by that,"]],[6641,["“gati” … “movement.”"]],[6644,["You get to the, your realization through"]],[6648,["“Shobhana-sulabha-gati.”"]],[6650,["There is no disgraceful behavior,"]],[6653,["or it is very beautifully done,"]],[6656,["and also “sulabha” is “easy.”"]],[6724,["“Shubha-kari” – Giver of auspiciousness."]],[6822,["Not the red. No, not the red. Now, two."]],[6888,["Unmarried."]],[6900,["One, one person."]],[6902,["All right, all of you!"]],[6911,["All of you have to hold it in the hand."]],[6916,["Now, hold it in your hand, all of you, here."]],[6918,["Now from top."]],[6920,["Yes, just hold it, right hand."]],[6924,["Hold it with the right. Here, one can hold it."]],[6930,["Now, put it."]],[6937,["So thank you."]],[6964,["“Pasha-hantri, Pasha-hantri” –"]],[6970,["You see, they are under bondage."]],[6973,["She’s the one who kills all the bondages, pash."]],[6981,["May God bless you."]],[7135,["“Vandaru-jana-vatsala”"]],[7139,["– those who bow to Her,"]],[7142,["She is … She is kind to them like a Mother."]],[7149,["She mothers them."]],[7151,["Those who bow to Her, She mothers them."]],[7202,["May God bless you."]]]);
